  "description": "Amend the frozen logical-buffer addendum so the ISA-L scalar-gap family declares five confirmatory cells.\n\n## Background\n\n`dev/active/2037941f-profile-and-optimize-mid-range-buffer-operations/logical-buffer-addendum.md` declares $m=6$ for the `2037941f-logical-isal-base-gap` family: five scalar-gap cells plus the declared unavailable `isal-dispatched-xor-gen` row, which the addendum says spends a comparison although it produces no pair. `trial_ledger::reserve` in `dev/tools/tuning-campaign-support/src/trial_ledger.rs` counts only non-exploratory cells and reserves five, so the frozen $m$ cannot be reserved and the family's confirmation (65c0e13d) cannot start. The invoker ruled on 2026-09-16 that the closed addendum is amended to $m=5$ rather than changing the protocol or the ledger mechanism. The unavailable row stays in every receipt with its reason and zero samples; it spends no comparison.\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- [hard] REQ-01: The addendum declares $m=5$ and $\\alpha_c=0.005$ for the ISA-L family, its family table row and the P-20 tail-support arithmetic agree with that count, and the unavailable dispatched row is described as retained without spending a comparison; no other family, cell, seed, margin or budget changes.\n- [hard] REQ-02: The amendment is recorded as a versioned change inside the addendum (an amendment record naming the reason, the date, the prior value and the invoker ruling) so the freeze history is preserved rather than rewritten.\n- [hard] REQ-03: Every artifact that pins the addendum's content follows: the producing-input closure `survey/logical-producing-inputs.json` is regenerated by its committed generator, the harness contract tests and the smoke reproduction pass against the amended addendum, and `git grep` finds no remaining statement of six confirmatory cells or of the 1/240 alpha for this family.\n\n## Notes\n\nFollow `dev/active/1a379447-zen3-cpu-performance/measurement-contract.md` and `dev/active/f547c394/protocol.md` (version 4). Untimed work. Depends on the merged logical-buffer harness (bb769456) so the regenerated closure covers its final sources.\n\n\nLead note (session 18): `logical-harness.md` states the ISA-L family's reservation spends the comparison \"($m = 6$) that the row declares\" (bb769456 report P4); this task edits that sentence in the same change, and regenerates `survey/logical-harness-validation.txt` only if its content changes with the amended addendum digest.\n\nSource references: [IsaL2026].",
